OL,3,AHurricane Polo intensifies into rare
OL,4,Acategory 5 storm off the coast of
OL,5,AMexico
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe slow-moving storm is fuelling up on
OL,8,Fextremely warm waters caused by the El
OL,9,FNino climate phenomenon and is the
OL,10,Fseason's third category 5 storm, the
OL,11,Fhighest level on the Saffir-Simpson
OL,12,Fscale.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
